{"id":896,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为助力学子明晰发展方向、破解升学与就业困惑、科学规划学业与职业道路，搭建朋辈互助、经验传承的交流桥梁，化学与化工学院于5月19日在17101H成功举办优秀毕业生升学就业分享交流会。本次活动邀请李晋松、杨楠、赵晨阳和包宇轩四位优秀毕业生，围绕保研、考研、考公、就业四大主流方向倾情分享干货经验，吸引众多学生踊跃参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUm7z4L8-PM8Q7UlzLiU8lDUl-ZMRrr7M4nkLmQfL4rVUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPn1hfnkhkM4QVnmU8M8CbnlnRL7-iMm9YMm6VL7CDMzfFnlrkoR-bUm6FMlQkn7-Jv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E1FADB76EF447F9EDC0B568267E0F650/EEB829B7/5FBDB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SLNUz8Um7ZLlUbol7QfM47anmUsMm-rDUmCbLllbLlM2U870gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4U1yPMkyaozW7oRN8LR-sLmGsU4GZoRVknz9YMlWkU8rFUlr2ol-aU8MFU4rRL7LJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\"></p><p>分享会上，四位优秀毕业生结合自身成长历程与实践经验，聚焦就业与升学的不同发展赛道，为在场学子拆解关键流程、传授实用技巧、点明常见误区，内容贴合实际，指导性强。</p><p>深耕保研之路的李晋松，系统梳理了大学前三年学业规划重点，详细讲解保研绩点核算、综测加分、科研竞赛、夏令营及预推免流程与面试技巧。他提醒同学们，保研重在长期积累，要保持稳定学业成绩，积极参与科研实践，提前打磨简历，提升综合竞争力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SnRrzRLmLDnzCbnlNliUm-aUmLDnRGrbozLDLzUiMmWkUm70gihFp2hmCIa0MSybLSy8oSy8Lzlsol7aUzCZM7W2oRG8MNLiU4MfLm78nRnFoz62MlWkMRWFMz7ioRGJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5914941579A0A684BF8046C5C3A214D4/97F5BB42/51580\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SnzVz7M7W2Lm98Ul8U8Uz-PLmA2LmNrbLNQfL467UmWfM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVL1yboSh7nzfkUmGiUm-ZMl-bozMVLNU4oRr2L4rfUlWFLlVRozNYMzrFUzCYn77Jv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\"></p><p>拥有丰富考研经验的杨楠，结合当前考研形势，带来全方位备考指南，分享了公共课与专业课全年复习规划、资料选择、刷题方法及各阶段备考重心。针对备考中常见的焦虑和效率低等问题，他介绍了心态调节方法，鼓励大家明确目标、科学备考。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SM7lzsL8LsMzvZUlzCDL8UPnRG4M47rZMzG8MR7DU8Q7ol70gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDM1ybMSybn7W7UzCaLzM7Um9DMmlDnR98U46RUzCZLlVFLzWfLm-DoRMFMzQkM7LJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/966959DBDA6013DB86656D84C7CA681A/12A22683/56B4C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SL7Uz8UzA2n7U4Ll7CPn7UiMlVVnmLraL4CinR9PozM7L470gihFp2hmCIa0LYysU1hRMSybUzn7UmLbMRUbMRUDMN-bU4rRLNrVMN7aMlVFM8C8MzGDUNrFUmvPnR-Jv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\"></p><p>专注考公方向的赵晨阳，从时间节点、岗位选择、考试内容、备考节奏四个核心维度展开讲解，清晰区分国考与省考差异，拆解行测、申论备考重点与答题技巧。他建议同学们提早布局备考、注重积累时政知识、理性选择岗位，拒绝低效学习。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SoRlzPL8rRnR7bMlRfVMRf7oR9PL4WrRMNUDU4CDL4VfL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8U1hfU1yZoRVfM4NYolVfnlQRn7nkoRrVnzGDL4UZM4MFo7CPUlCanRrFMRUZLzUJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/84BAB881A7929AAEFCDDB85EE0634873/8F1AF0D5/44814\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SnmlzZMmL8UmARnlzrRozMknm-iL7-rPUN-bL462LzNZnR70gihFp2hmCIa0nSy4UShRL1hVLzvYnmlPU4TfLmMkMNU8ozLaU4GYL4NbLNWFUNWVMNlbLRAFoRvioRLJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\"></p><p>立足就业实战的包宇轩，聚焦求职痛点，围绕简历优化、实习积累、秋招春招规划、线上面试技巧、职场能力提升等内容细致分享。他强调，企业重视实操与实习经历，建议同学们尽早参与对口实习、打磨简历、提升表达与应变能力，从容应对求职竞争。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SM7LzbLmLbn7UYUl4v8oz-DL8UPMlLr8olLZM7lDMlUiLzL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkMkysL1yPL7lso7l4L7lYUzU4UzQVn7n2MRCYLRMkoRAFLNrVoRvsMR6FMl78nRlJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CB47210E78E30E2A43A6EDDF46203B88/2EE87747/5A4D5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SMz6zVUzTkL4lsLlzVRLNVknl78MNrr7nRNPMmnfU4v8Mmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyYnShfnkyDoR9bMNl8LmLDLl-bUmMfnmGYM7lYLzC8L8WFnlMVM4LZM8QFUmLiLmUJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png\"></p><p>分享结束后，四位优秀毕业生与在场同学展开互动交流，耐心解答疑问，现场交流氛围热烈而浓厚。</p><p>成娟老师作总结讲话。她对四位优秀毕业生的倾情分享表示感谢，并希望同学们以优秀学长学姐为榜样，结合自身实际找准发展定位、科学规划成长之路，在适合自己的赛道上奋力拼搏、绽放光彩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUzGziL47YMRAknllnfn7MfMlUiL4-rPL4nkUzWVLzviUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8nSyYnSy4Ml7DnlW2M7WkLm78nmVVLlLPL87bnzVVUzTFLNCaUlW2MNQFLm-sMRLJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F4E2E35A6EBF4BB214F1E1C13A9E1EA9/2F0ABF6F/22743\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUzGziL47YMRAknllnfn7MfMlUiL4-rPL4nkUzWVLzviUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8nSyYnSy4Ml7DnlW2M7WkLm78nmVVLlLPL87bnzVVUzTFLNCaUlW2MNQFLm-sMRLJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次优秀毕业生升学就业分享会的成功举办，有效化解了学院学子在升学就业中的困惑，搭建了优质朋辈经验交流平台，进一步强化了学生的生涯规划意识。未来，化学与化工学院将持续立足学生成长需求，常态化开展经验分享与就业帮扶活动，助力学子实现高质量升学与高质量就业。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hgxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUm7z4L8-PM8Q7UlzLiU8lDUl-ZMRrr7M4nkLmQfL4rVUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPn1hfnkhkM4QVnmU8M8CbnlnRL7-iMm9YMm6VL7CDMzfFnlrkoR-bUm6FMlQkn7-Jv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiMzNPgtA8pUIcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45591&e=.png"}